    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Trees</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Compare two subtrees</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/symmetric-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 101</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Symmetric Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A tree is symmetric when its left subtree is the mirror of its right subtree: walk both at once, pairing outer with outer and inner with inner. O(n) time, O(h) stack (or an O(w) queue).</p>\n"
